# yuri

simple, sweet, and quick library for handling cryptocurrency payments in go

NOTE: this is extremely experimental

currently supports:
[x] Ethereum (+ERC20)
[x] Litecoin
[x] Bitcoin
[x] Monero
[x] Solana (+tokens)

licensed under the [AGPLv3](./LICENSE)
examples [here](./example_instance_test.go) or on `go doc`
